        "base": "https://www.wananga.com/feed/rss2",
        "language": null,
        "type": "text/html",
        "value": "<div>\n  <h3>\n    <span>\n      \n           Kaitunu, Te Whare Manaaki Tangata\n          \n    </span>\n  </h3>\n  <h5>\n    <span>\n      \n           1.0 FTE Permanent Full time\n          \n    </span>\n  </h5>\n  <h5>\n    <span>\n      \n           Te W\u0101nanga o Raukawa, \u014ctaki\n          \n    </span>\n  </h5>\n</div>\n<div>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      \n           Give expression to manaakitanga as a cook within our busy campus k\u0101uta ensuring our students and visitors are nourished during residential seminars, hui rumaki, conferences, meetings and events. You will work with the Kaiwhakahaere to produce great food, being rostered over seven days. Apply now to advance your career in a kaupapa M\u0101ori environment, demonstrating your culinary creativity with opportunity for study and further development within a fun, wh\u0101nau-orientated team.\n          \n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      <br />\n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      <span>\n        \n            Visit our\n           \n      </span>\n    </span>\n    <a href=\"https://www.wananga.com/job-vacancies\">\n      \n           Job Vacancy\n          \n    </a>\n    <span>\n      <span>\n        \n            section to view all jobs and employee benefits.\n           \n      </span>\n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      <br />\n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      \n           For further information or to apply for this role, please contact:\n          \n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      \n           Dionne Seng, Kaihaut\u016b Te Whare Tiaki Rawa\n          \n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      \n           \u012am\u0113ra:\u00a0\n          \n    </span>\n    <a href=\"mailto:dionne.seng@twor-otaki.ac.nz\" target=\"_blank\">\n      \n           dionne.seng@twor-otaki.ac.nz\n          \n    </a>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      \n           Waea: 06 3649011 extn 757\n          \n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      <br />\n    </span>\n  </p>\n</div>"
      }
